OL,3,AWild dogs record 2,500-mile trek across
OL,4,AZambia in search of a mate
OL,5,
OL,6,FA pack of African wild dogs has
OL,7,Fcompleted a record-breaking 2,485-mile
OL,8,F(4000km) journey across Zambia.
OL,10,FScientists say it is the furthest
OL,11,Frecorded distance for any African land
OL,12,Fmammal searching for a mate, offering
OL,13,Fhope that wildlife can travel across
OL,14,Fvast distances despite growing human
OL,15,Fpressures.
OL,17,FThe three brothers zigzagged across
OL,18,FZambia, navigating a landscape
OL,19,Fincreasingly shaped by people and
OL,20,Favoiding obstacles including major
OL,21,Fcities.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,317,300,200,140,0,100
