OL,3,AWild dogs record 2,500-mile trek across
OL,4,AZambia in search of a mate
OL,5,
OL,6,FHowever, other wild dogs tracked with
OL,7,FGPS collars in the study died in
OL,8,Fillegal snares, underlining the dangers
OL,9,Fthey face.
